<title>UK: T.T. up on results, outlook, talk of upgrade.</title>
<headline>T.T. up on results, outlook, talk of upgrade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in T.T.Group Plc jumped to an eight-month high on Monday after the company reported good results and issued an upbeat forecast, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 1136 GMT, the shares were up 11p to 346.</p>
<p>Talk that Dresdner Kleinwort Benson would soon upgrade its earnings estimates also bolstered the shares, dealers said.</p>
<p>The brokerage already has a &quot;strong buy&quot; recommendation on the stock. The analyst declined to comment on a possible upgrade.</p>
</text>
